<%# The install-once elapsed ticker: the board/ticker_dom module advances every
    [data-release-ticker] span once a second (the Next Release timer, the CI meter's
    short clock, "ago" stamps, stage countdowns, operator-window chips). The modes are
    listed in that module; the formatters are in board/ticker and match their server
    twins (ApplicationHelper#format_elapsed_clock, #compact_elapsed_short,
    Devops::Windows.format_clock), so the server's first paint and the first tick
    agree. %>
<%= javascript_tag 'import "board/ticker_dom"', type: "module", nonce: true %>
